		<div>Quest have name Secrets of Runeye...</div><div>a) Talk to fairy in first from entrance Mino Room </div><div>b) Go to second mino room (past golems) and clean it by the right wall you will find pile of goo here you will get optic nerve</div><div>c) Go to Hulk room (right spur next to mino room 2 where you just got nerve) clean spawn, clean advanced room. Now you can see in next room few hulks you can either clean em all or just get one person hug left wall go fast in fast out it will force hammerhead mino spawn - kill it and get second part that fairy asked you for</div><div>d) Talk to fairy again she will send you find Junk. He is in Chef room (past brewer room where you got 200&nbsp;goblin quest&nbsp;onto right). Clean the entrance of room and group onto your right, Junk staying by dead evil eye...</div><div>e) Junk will send you find the books. From the chef room go staight you will get to room with 3-4 miners (here btw Evil Eye Legend and Lore book hidden in coal cart). Clean entrance of advanced room and go to right. You will see none agro evil eye roam here ... you will need him later. Now bear in mind next room trapped... So start pull room into hallway once you clean path onto your left to forge rush in as a team and wait till trap come after you. Trap is 2 wave - first wave is &quot;-&quot; coned soldiers once last of dead, big named will spawn Guard Master - he always drop belt as loot (pretty decent btw). Once he dead get 1 person examine books behind forge it will force books spawn. Kill the spawn get upgrade of the quest.</div><div>f) Read the book you got as a reward and talk with named eye now.... He will send you kill thing of Shattered Iron..</div><div>g) Thing of Shattered Iron spawn in same room where you killing torturers (past miners past armorer past boars room). Room trapped. You will need kill first and fast a) Occuslus Wizard + 4 torturers b) 4 Boar Protectors c) 2 War boar. Thing have a lot hp but need to be killed fairly fast or you will catch respawn of wizard...</div><div>h) Once you killed Thing go talk to Duke (Named Eye) again he will send you find gate to throne room ....</div><div>That a step where I am now and not really have any idea where the hell that throne room</div>
