	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
		<p>This quest is given by Daisy Winterhope (at the docks), and is the first part of the quest that grants access to the Enchanted Lands. You must be level 25 to be given this quest. <br /><br />The first order of business is to gather 25 Nerius Crab Carapaces. These are found on the crabs that surround the docks. They do not drop every time, so be prepared to kill for a while. <br /><br />After you have killed all of the crabs you need to return to Daisy Winterhope at the docks. <br /><br />She will then send you out to kill Ash Owlbears until you have 13 sinews. These are rarely found solo, so you will be best served to get a group. After you have done this, speak to Daisy Winterhope again. <br /><br />This will close the quest. See Maid for the Mist - Part II for details on continuation (under related </p><p><strong><font size="4">PART II</font></strong></p><p>This is the second part of the Enchanted Lands access quest. It requires that you are level 25 and is given by Seamist Fairy Nerina at the Nektulos docks after you complete the first quest of the series (see related quests). <br /><br />You must find and slay the disguised entity from the Sea of Mist. This involes speaking to the Fisherman near the docks (Aurvill, Dralyix, Djaani). After you have done this you should wait at the tent near the docks (where Djaani and Aurvill are) until Draylix spawns and kills them. He will not aggro you immediately so if you are caught off guard, you have time. <br /><br />You must kill Draylix. He&#39;s a level 30 ^^ mob, but isn&#39;t that tough. If you are in a full group of level 25+ he should be no problem. <br /><br />After killing him return to Seamist Fairy Nerina and inform her of what happened. She will refer you to Captain Corrigan on the docks. <br /><br />IT IS VERY IMPORTANT that nobody speaks to Captain Corrigan until your party is all gathered near him and ready to go. Once you follow his dialogue the Maid for the Mist Part II quest will close and everyone will be teleported to a special instanced zone called Maid for the Mist. You need to be full mana and gathered together or you will fail this part, it is not a cakewalk. <br /><br />When you are all ready speak to the Captain. This quest continues at part 3 under related quests.</p>
